<p>SCP-(number)<br />
SCP-(number)-1</p>
<p>Object Class:<br />
Safe</p>
<p>&quot;Blood Angels&quot;</p>
<p>A Glass Orb that emits a bright red glow, stored in a white glass box, if touched the victim's skin is<br />
disintegrated and their blood/muscle tissue will form into wings, and will be idle. If the Orb is approached by any weapon, melee weapon, or person intending to harm it/shatter it, will be approached by scp-(number)-1 and forced<br />
to touch the orb, effectively multiplying.</p>
<p>SCP-(Number)-1 is able to be neutralized via a water hose, or anything that emits water.<br />
small items like perfume bottles, spray bottles, or cups of waters only make SCP-(number)-1 angrier, and more aggressive.</p>
<p>If there are no scp-number-1s present, and someone intends to damage the orb, the orb itself will not take any damage<br />
and will be &quot;un-killable&quot;, as it's only weakened when there are scp-number-1's in presence.</p>

