			<div class="content" id="post-content-4826534">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Essentially it is a sleeping mask which allows the wearer to receive the perspective and sensations of a chosen target unbeknownst to them, starting with their sight and escalating all the way to their thoughts.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> None, save for a development in research methods and a technical exoneration.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> This particular concept hones in on a mix of scopophobia, schizophrenia, and paranoia; the irrational anxieties related to being cosmically spied on.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I have a mostly complete draft, though there is more I would like to add should it be deemed suitable.</p>

